        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Kathmandu</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 185 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">The oldest dated find is a statue of 185 CE from Maligaon; tradition holds that the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/licchavi">Licchavi</a> king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gunakamadeva">Gunakamadeva</a> joined two older settlements, Yambu and Yengal, into one city, and legend says the valley was a lake drained by Manjushri.</span></div>
